The '''Jalindi Station''', also known as the '''Jalindi relay''' or the '''Jalindi outpost''', was an [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] communications outpost located on the [[planet]] [[Jalindi]].

==Description==
[[File:Jalindi_mountain_spikes.jpg|thumb|left|250px|The Jalindi relay dish among the world's rocky mountains]]
Sporting a massive [[Communications relay|relay dish]] developed by the [[Galactic Empire]],<ref name="Jalindi Station DB" /> Jalindi Station was a [[Communications relay|communications outpost]] situated atop one of the [[mountain]] spikes of the [[planet]] [[Jalindi]].<ref name="Jalindi Station DB">{{Databank|jalindi-station|Jalindi Station}}</ref> Jalindi outpost<ref name="INR" /> amplified communications,<ref name="Jalindi Station DB" /> allowing for the Empire to expand their detection screen in surrounding [[sector]]s,<ref name="INR" /> conducting large scale information dissemination and the monitoring of transmissions,<ref name="Jalindi Station DB" /> impeding [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|rebel]] movements.<ref name="INR" />

==History==
Around [[1 BBY]],<ref name="Chronology Note" /> the [[Spectres]] were [[Mission to Jalindi|deployed]] to install a spike on the Jalindi relay, so that the rebellion could tap into the Imperial network, and spy on [[Imperial Navy|Imperial fleet]] movements. The rebels were spotted when an [[Arquitens-class command cruiser|''Arquitens''-class command cruiser]], the [[Marauder (Arquitens-class command cruiser)|''Marauder'']] arrived, and were forced to scuttle the mission by destroying the Imperial relay dish instead, which [[Saw Gerrera]] accomplished when he arrived.<ref name="INR" />

